paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205380/extras/e09f8f5696938603ffe748cfa5daf427.avif?t=1766181393\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205380/extras_big/e09f8f5696938603ffe748cfa5daf427.avif?t=1766181393 width=800 height=488 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Omelet You Cook is created by two indie devs and draws inspiration from beloved arcade roguelikes like <i>Balatro</i>, <i>Luck Be a Landlord</i>, and <i>Ballionaire</i>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Feature List:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd44 25+ customer traits that shake up every run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd53 120+ delicious (and sometimes ridiculous) ingredients</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd57 80+ synergy-enabling helpers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddc0 A shop to expand your culinary arsenal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd51 Unlockable ingredients and upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf36\ufe0f Multiple difficulties and starter ingredient sets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205380/extras/8214371f31c2bd4376878478d86795fb.avif?t=1766181393\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205380/extras_big/8214371f31c2bd4376878478d86795fb.avif?t=1766181393 width=800 height=147 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you\u2019ve got what it takes to become an overworked cafeteria lady? Alright then; <strong>Omelet You Cook</strong>.</p>","developers":["Dan Schumacher","Hjalte Tagmose"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Ac